<HelpTab>
    <FluentText>
        <a href="/manage/projectioncontrol">Projection Control</a> lists every program that's running, on which
        kiosk and screen, and which step it's on. A program started for a one-off moment is marked
        <strong>Triggered</strong>.
    </FluentText>
    <ul>
        <li>Pause and resume a program.</li>
        <li>Use <strong>Previous step</strong> and <strong>Next step</strong> to move through it.</li>
        <li><strong>Stop</strong> ends it.</li>
        <li><strong>Refresh</strong> reloads the list.</li>
    </ul>
    <FluentText>
        Changes show on the kiosk straight away. The same controls are on the Projection Status dashboard
        widget.
    </FluentText>
</HelpTab>
